  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 404,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.261,
            0.13,
            0.713,
            0.161
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "参读材料二 蒙特卡罗方法"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.209,
            0.864,
            0.272
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "我们聚焦于由给定的模型直接产生大量的样本. 这些样本反映了模型的统计性能, 有关模型的问题能由研究样本的统计性能得到回答. 我们研究样本的统计性能得到关于模型的问题的回答, 这样的方法称为蒙特卡罗方法, 又称为蒙特卡罗模拟."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.277,
            0.864,
            0.317
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "如果我们能在计算机上模拟一统计模型,那么就能自模型产生一大批数据样本,也就能用研究这些样本的性质代替对模型本身的研究,从而得到所需的结果."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.322,
            0.864,
            0.362
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "例 1 长方形金属板的长度 X 和宽度 Y 分别服从分布  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X \\sim U(2.9, 3.1)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  和  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Y \\sim U(1.9, 2.1)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，X、Y 均以 m 计，且两者相互独立。试估计金属板面积 XY 的数学期望。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.369,
            0.386,
            0.385
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "解 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X, Y"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的分布函数分别为"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.39,
            0.775,
            0.467
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_404_equation_5.jpg",
          "content": "F _ {X} (x) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} 0, & x <   2. 9, \\\\ \\frac {x - 2 . 9}{0 . 2}, & 2. 9 \\leqslant x <   3. 1, \\\\ 1, & x \\geqslant 3. 1. \\end{array} \\quad F _ {Y} (y) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} 0, & y <   1. 9, \\\\ \\frac {y - 1 . 9}{0 . 2}, & 1. 9 \\leqslant y <   2. 1, \\\\ 1, & y \\geqslant 2. 1. \\end{array} \\right. \\right."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.473,
            0.674,
            0.502
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "现在分别产生 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X, Y"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的随机数. 设 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "U = U(0,1)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 令 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "U = \\frac{X - 2.9}{0.2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 得"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.421,
            0.51,
            0.864,
            0.526
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_404_equation_7.jpg",
          "content": "X = 2. 9 + 0. 2 U. \\tag {*1}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.534,
            0.389,
            0.564
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "设 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "U\\sim U(0,1)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，令 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "V = \\frac{Y - 1.9}{0.2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 得"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.421,
            0.571,
            0.864,
            0.587
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_404_equation_9.jpg",
          "content": "Y = 1. 9 + 0. 2 V. \\tag {*_{2}}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.594,
            0.864,
            0.634
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "按 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(\\ast_{1})"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 式产生随机变量X的10 000个随机数，按 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(\\ast_{2})"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 式产生Y的10 000个随机数，这样就得到A=XY的样本容量为10 000的样本值，列表如下:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.645,
            0.865,
            0.789
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.115,
                0.645,
                0.865,
                0.789
              ],
              "image_path": "raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_404_table_11.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td>长度x</td><td>宽度y</td><td>面积xy</td></tr><tr><td>3.055 969</td><td>2.091 012</td><td>6.390 068</td></tr><tr><td>2.976 204</td><td>2.037 167</td><td>6.063 026</td></tr><tr><td>⋮</td><td>⋮</td><td>⋮</td></tr><tr><td>3.003 077</td><td>1.929 107</td><td>5.793 258</td></tr></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.808,
            0.864,
            0.866
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "以 A 的样本均值  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{1}{10\\ 000}\\sum_{i=1}^{10\\ 000}x_{i}y_{i}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  作为金属板面积 A 的数学期望的估计, 得到面积 A 的数学期望的近似值为 6.000762 m²."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.872,
            0.864,
            0.911
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "此例说明,用蒙特卡罗方法得到的 A 的数学期望,与 A 的数学期望的真值  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "E(A)=E(XY)=E(X)E(Y)=6\\ m^{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  非常接近. □"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 405,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.395,
            0.049,
            0.624,
            0.065
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "参读材料二 蒙特卡罗方法"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.801,
            0.052,
            0.866,
            0.065
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "· 391 ·"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.088,
            0.884,
            0.149
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "例2 设一设备需经两个独立的组装阶段. 第一阶段的组装时间 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (以 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{h}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 计) 是一个随机变量, 服从均值为 1 的指数分布, 第二阶段的组装时间 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Y"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 也是一个随机变量且 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Y \\sim N(3,1)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 试估计整个组装时间 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X + Y"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.155,
            0.559,
            0.172
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "解 下面用蒙特卡罗方法给出  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X + Y"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  的直方图."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.177,
            0.56,
            0.195
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "设 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "U\\sim U(0,1)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，在参读材料一例4中令 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\theta = 1"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，则"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.467,
            0.202,
            0.879,
            0.216
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_405_equation_5.jpg",
          "content": "X = - \\ln U \\quad (* _ {3})"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.221,
            0.882,
            0.281
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "就是均值为1的指数分布随机变量. 又按参读材料一例6, 设 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "U_{i} \\sim U(0,1), i = 1,2,\\dots,12"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 且它们相互独立, 则 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X = \\sum_{i=1}^{12} U_{i} - 6 \\stackrel{\\text{近似}}{\\sim} N(0,1)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 于是"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.471,
            0.286,
            0.879,
            0.3
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_405_equation_7.jpg",
          "content": "Y = X + 3 \\quad \\left(* _ {4}\\right)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.306,
            0.882,
            0.39
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "近似服从正态分布 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "N(3,1)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ". 在计算机上分别按 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(\\ast_{3})"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 式和 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(\\ast_{4})"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 式产生 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 和 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Y"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的独立的样本值（样本容量为 10000），利用这 10000 个数据作出 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X + Y"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的频率直方图，如图 1 所示，我们就可以用直方图顶部的台阶形曲线作为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X + Y"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的概率密度曲线的近似. 从而可以对随机变量 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X + Y"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的性质作出统计推断. 例如，"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X + Y"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 落在区间 (3.4, 4.2) 的概率可估计为"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.386,
            0.395,
            0.623,
            0.412
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_405_equation_9.jpg",
          "content": "P \\{3. 4 <   X + Y <   4. 2 \\} \\approx 0. 6 2."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.416,
            0.466,
            0.433
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "R 语言的程序和作出的直方图如下:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.438,
            0.424,
            0.587
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "code_body",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.133,
                0.438,
                0.424,
                0.587
              ],
              "content": "> N = 10000; z<-numeric(N)\n> for(i in 1:N){\n+    x<-(-log(runif(1,0,1)))\n+    y<-rnorm(1,3,1)\n+    z[i]<-x+y\n+ }\n> hist(z)"
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "guess_lang": "diff"
        },
        {
          "type": "chart",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.329,
            0.604,
            0.681,
            0.833
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "chart_body",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.329,
                0.604,
                0.681,
                0.833
              ],
              "image_path": "raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_405_chart_12.jpg",
              "content": "| Bin (z) | Frequency |\n| --- | --- |\n| 0~1 | ~50 |\n| 1~2 | ~500 |\n| 2~3 | ~1800 |\n| 3~4 | ~3000 |\n| 4~5 | ~2550 |\n| 5~6 | ~1250 |\n| 6~7 | ~550 |\n| 7~8 | ~200 |\n| 8~9 | ~50 |\n| 9~10 | ~25 |\n| 10~11 | ~10 |"
            },
            {
              "type": "chart_caption",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.487,
                0.841,
                0.524,
                0.857
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "图1"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "histogram"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.876,
            0.88,
            0.915
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在统计数据分析中,许多人们感兴趣的问题能够归结为求某个随机变量 X 的函数  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "h(X)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  的数学期望  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "E[h(X)]"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . 令  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\varphi(x)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  表示 X 的概率密度, 由强大数定律, 若  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X_{1}, X_{2}, \\cdots, X_{n}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  是相互独"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
